fast-rdp-server (0.4.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remote Credential Guard (mstsc /remoteGuard): refused with a negotiation
    response instead of a dropped connection (fastrdp-freerdp3 3.32.2-2); new
    opt-in proxy.ini [FastRDP] AcceptRemoteGuard (Ansible
    fastrdp_accept_remote_guard) accepts it identity-only, discarding the
    forwarded Kerberos tickets; the broker gets "remote_guard": true.

  * Deploys also upgrade the vendored FreeRDP/xrdp packages when they are older
    than the checkout's packaging (fastrdp-freerdp3 3.32.2-2).
 -- Marcel Ritter <marcel@linux-ng.de>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0200

